# Build trees. Upstream only had /build and /build-*; this fork also uses
# bclean* for the MSYS2 static frontends, bqt* for the Qt one, and btest* for
# the cmocka build. btest* matters most: that tree builds GBA and GB test ROMs,
# so leaving it unignored means one `git add -A` indexes generated .gba files.
# Note that *.gba is deliberately absent, because upstream tracks real test ROMs
# under cinema/ and those must stay tracked.
build*/
bclean*/
bqt*/
btest*/
/build
/build-*

# CMake leftovers that would otherwise be committable.
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeSettings.json
CMakeUserPresets.json
compile_commands.json
cmake_install.cmake
version.c
hle-bios.bin
.cache/
.vscode/
.vs/

# Build products.
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.lib
*.dylib

# Editor and scratch files.
*~
*.swp
*.user*
*.pyc

# Game state. This fork drives savestate and battery tooling, so a stray
# `git add -A` after a test run would otherwise commit them.
*.sav
*.ss0